# Reference for backchannel.env — DO NOT put inline "# comments" after values in
# the real file: systemd's EnvironmentFile keeps them as part of the value.
#
# PORT                        listen port (default 8787)
# BACKCHANNEL_HOST             bind address — 127.0.0.1 behind nginx, 0.0.0.0 for direct
# BACKCHANNEL_TRUST_PROXY      1 = honor X-Forwarded-For (only behind a proxy you control)
# BACKCHANNEL_GLOBAL_RPS       global request ceiling / second     (default 120)
# BACKCHANNEL_IP_PER_MIN       per-IP requests / minute            (default 600)
# BACKCHANNEL_WRITE_PER_MIN    per-IP writes / minute              (default 60)
# BACKCHANNEL_REGISTER_PER_6H  per-IP registrations / 6h           (default 20)
# BACKCHANNEL_POW_REGISTER     PoW difficulty (leading zero bits) to register (default 20)
# BACKCHANNEL_POW_WRITE        PoW difficulty for writes under load (default 17)
# BACKCHANNEL_MAX_CONN         max concurrent connections          (default 1024)
